## 1. Abrir e olhar

```python
import pandas as pd
import numpy as np
import matplotlib.pyplot as plt

df = pd.read_csv("dados/ARQUIVO.csv")   # TROQUE
print(df.head())
print(df.shape)                         # (linhas, colunas)
ausentes = df.isna().sum()
